// PR-4 of TODO/20260612-party-rendering-and-party-pages-plan.md.
//
// `loadPartyDetail(party_id)` assembles the per-party detail page
// view-model (header + KPI strip + LS/VS history + strongholds +
// metadata) by reading the backend-derived party-page marts under
// `datasets/data/marts/party_pages/` plus the parties.csv metadata via
// the PR-1 `loadPartyMeta` accessor.
//
// The marts are generated by:
//
//   python -m yen_gov derive-party-pages --root .
//
// and validated by a Tier-B freshness signature. The browser MUST NOT
// read `datasets/data/datapoints/electoral/*.csv` for a party detail
// page: that corpus is ~177 MB and belongs in the local backend
// pipeline, not in a citizen route.

